      "name": "Improved Grab",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/grab.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>To use this ability, the tyrannosaur must hit an opponent two or more size categories smaller than itself with its bite attack. If it gets a hold, it shakes the grabbed opponent back and forth, automatically dealing bite damage each round. Once the opponent stops resisting, the tyrannosaur attempts to swallow on its next turn.</p>",
